-- Did it find relevant content even though those exact words aren't in the article?
Not really. The results mostly repeat very similar wording, so it looks more like keyword matching than true semantic understanding.
To be sure, you’d need to try queries that express the same idea with completely different words and see if it still retrieves the 
same concepts.




